LiquidationPeriphery::onLiquidateCallback
├── when caller is not a registered mint or borrow market
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
└── when caller is a registered market
    ├── when market in callback data does not match caller
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
    ├── it should transfer seized collateral to the liquidator
    ├── given repayViaUsm is false
    │   └── it should pull borrow token from liquidator and approve market
    └── given repayViaUsm is true
        ├── it should pull underlying from liquidator, sell in usm, and approve borrow token to market
        ├── when stable token bought equals borrow amount to repay
        │   └── it should not refund stable to liquidator
        └── when stable token bought is greater than borrow amount to repay
            └── it should refund excess stable token to liquidator
